        "text_pUVNHF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "&nbsp;<strong>Welcome to Adira Earth!</strong> Our journey began with a personal search for a simpler approach to everyday skincare. After experiencing increasingly sensitive and reactive skin, I became more conscious of the products I was using and began looking for something with fewer ingredients. A friend introduced me to traditional Aleppo soap from France. I was drawn to its simplicity, its long history and its traditional combination of olive oil and laurel oil. After making it part of my own routine, I became fascinated by the centuries-old soap-making tradition and the different laurel oil concentrations. That personal discovery eventually became <strong>Adira Earth</strong>. Today, we bring traditional Aleppo soap to Australia in six laurel oil concentrations, from <strong>12% to 55%</strong>, giving customers the opportunity to explore the percentage and cleansing feel that suits their routine. Adira Earth is about bringing time-honoured traditions into modern everyday life through thoughtfully selected products and simple, considered ingredients.&nbsp;",
            "description_size": "p"
          }
        },
